# MusicBrainz outgoing paths (label=how). The real file, egress.env, lives
# only on the server beside swap.sh and is never committed: it names the
# pool's addresses.
#
# Each label names one outgoing address (logs show labels, never dotted
# addresses). "default" is the primary address; each :lo-hi port range
# becomes its own source address through a host SNAT rule (iptables nat
# POSTROUTING, comment holyarrs-mb-egress). One address only:
# HOLYARRS_MB_EGRESS= (empty), then ./swap.sh <current tag>.
HOLYARRS_MB_EGRESS=ipA=default,ipB=:21000-21999,ipC=:22000-22999
